1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Nightingale is a shared-care note. It is not an autonomous medical system.

2
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:45,000
The Top Card has at most six items. It shows content, action, status, risk, and source.

3
00:00:45,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Ranking priority is not a medical risk score. This quote comes from an immutable source.

4
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:35,000
A revert creates a new snapshot. It never erases the old version.

5
00:01:35,000 --> 00:02:00,000
Comments are threaded, and tasks keep their source comment and assignee.

6
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:35,000
The derived summary is not the original record. The immutable original remains the source of truth.

7
00:02:35,000 --> 00:03:00,000
The fixture is the default. DeepSeek is optional and receives synthetic redacted text only.

8
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:25,000
This is a Level-C Voice demo. The transcript is a mock fixture because local ASR was unavailable.

9
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:40,000
The prototype does not claim clinical validation, production PHI capture, or model quality.
